{"seq":2,"slug":"physical-quantity-sensing","title":"物理量传感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/physical-quantity-sensing","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"物理量传感\">物理量传感</h1><p>温度、压力、力、加速度、磁场——这些是工业与消费电子里被测得最多的非电物理量。它们的共同难题是：自然界并不直接给出电压，必须借某种物理效应把「热的多少、压的多少、动的多少」翻译成电阻、电荷或电压的变化。这一篇逐一拆解最主流的几类物理量传感的底层机理与典型电路接法，把<a href=\"sensor-classification\">传感器分类与特性</a>里抽象的「自源/调制」「灵敏度/时间常数」落到具体器件上。光与图像不在此列，它们自成体系，见<a href=\"photo-imaging-sensing\">光电与成像传感</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>物理量传感的核心是「敏感机理 + 读出方式」两层。敏感机理决定被测量如何改变某个电参数，读出方式决定如何把这个电参数变成可放大的信号。下图给出五类主流物理量各自的链路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[温度] --&gt; T1[热电偶/RTD/热敏电阻/IC]&#10;  P[压力/力] --&gt; P1[压阻膜片/电容膜片/压电]&#10;  A[加速度/角速度] --&gt; A1[MEMS 电容梳齿/科氏振动]&#10;  M[磁场/电流/位置] --&gt; M1[霍尔/磁阻 AMR-GMR-TMR]&#10;  H[湿度/气体] --&gt; H1[电容吸湿/电化学/MOX]&#10;  T1 --&gt; R[读出: 电压/电阻/电容/电荷]&#10;  P1 --&gt; R&#10;  A1 --&gt; R&#10;  M1 --&gt; R&#10;  H1 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; C[送往信号调理]\">graph TD\n  T[温度] --&gt; T1[热电偶/RTD/热敏电阻/IC]\n  P[压力/力] --&gt; P1[压阻膜片/电容膜片/压电]\n  A[加速度/角速度] --&gt; A1[MEMS 电容梳齿/科氏振动]\n  M[磁场/电流/位置] --&gt; M1[霍尔/磁阻 AMR-GMR-TMR]\n  H[湿度/气体] --&gt; H1[电容吸湿/电化学/MOX]\n  T1 --&gt; R[读出: 电压/电阻/电容/电荷]\n  P1 --&gt; R\n  A1 --&gt; R\n  M1 --&gt; R\n  H1 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; C[送往信号调理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理量</th>\n<th>主流机理</th>\n<th>输出参数</th>\n<th>关键弱点</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>塞贝克 / 电阻温度系数</td>\n<td>电压 / 电阻</td>\n<td>自热、热滞后</td>\n<td>工业测温、电池管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压力</td>\n<td>压阻 / 电容膜片</td>\n<td>电阻 / 电容</td>\n<td>温漂、封装应力</td>\n<td>胎压、血压、气象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惯性</td>\n<td>MEMS 电容 / 科氏力</td>\n<td>电容变化</td>\n<td>零偏漂移</td>\n<td>手机、车身稳定、导航</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁场/电流</td>\n<td>霍尔 / 磁阻</td>\n<td>电压 / 电阻</td>\n<td>温漂、偏置磁场</td>\n<td>电流检测、编码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>湿度/气体</td>\n<td>电容吸湿 / 电化学</td>\n<td>电容 / 电流</td>\n<td>老化、交叉敏感</td>\n<td>暖通、空气质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"温度传感-四条路线的取舍\">温度传感：四条路线的取舍</h2><p>温度是最常被测的量，四类器件各占一隅。<strong>热电偶</strong> 靠两种金属接点的塞贝克效应产生与温差成正比的微弱电动势（K 型约 41 μV/℃），量程极宽（可达 1300 ℃ 以上）、自源、坚固，但输出是 mV 级且非线性，需要冷端补偿。<strong>RTD（铂电阻，如 Pt100）</strong> 利用金属电阻随温度近线性升高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_T = R_0(1 + \\alpha T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，精度与长期稳定性最佳，但需恒流激励且价格高。<strong>热敏电阻（NTC）</strong> 电阻随温度指数下降，灵敏度极高但强非线性，遵循近似关系</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{T} = \\frac{1}{T_0} + \\frac{1}{B}\\ln\\frac{R}{R_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>适合 -40 到 150 ℃ 的低成本精测。<strong>硅基 IC 温度传感器</strong> 直接利用 PN 结电压的温度系数，内部已数字化，靠<a href=\"../interface/sensor-interfaces-buses\">I2C/SPI 接口</a>输出，是电池管理与主板测温的主力。选哪条路，本质是在量程、精度、成本、是否需要外部<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">调理电路</a>之间权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压力与力-膜片背后的两种物理\">压力与力：膜片背后的两种物理</h2><p>压力传感几乎都是「让被测压力推动一片膜片，再测膜片形变」。形变如何转成电信号有两条主路。<strong>压阻式</strong> 在膜片上扩散或溅射应变电阻，膜片弯曲使电阻随应变变化，靠惠斯通电桥读出——这是<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">信号调理</a>里桥式接法的经典舞台。应变片的灵敏度用应变系数（gauge factor）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GF = (\\Delta R/R)/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GF</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 描述，金属箔约 2，半导体压阻可达 100 以上但温漂更大。<strong>电容式</strong> 把膜片做成电容的一个极板，形变改变极距从而改变电容，功耗极低、温漂小，是 MEMS 气压计（手机里测海拔的那颗）的主流。</p>\n<p>测力与测压同源：称重传感器（load cell）本质就是带应变片的弹性体。动态力与振动则交给压电式——石英或压电陶瓷受力产生电荷，自源、带宽极宽，但无法测静态力（电荷会泄漏），其逆效应正是<a href=\"../actuators/electromagnetic-piezo\">压电执行器</a>的工作原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"惯性传感-mems-如何称出加速度与角速度\">惯性传感：MEMS 如何称出加速度与角速度</h2><p>加速度计与陀螺仪是今天出货量最大的物理量传感器之一，几乎全部基于 MEMS 工艺（其微加工细节见<a href=\"../systems/mems-microsystems\">MEMS 与微系统</a>）。<strong>MEMS 加速度计</strong> 内部有一个由弹簧悬挂的微小检测质量块，加速时质量块相对位移，改变梳齿电容；位移满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = ma/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，因此电容变化正比于加速度。<strong>MEMS 陀螺仪</strong> 测角速度，靠的是科里奥利效应：让质量块以固定频率振动，当整体转动时，科氏力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}_c = -2m\\,\\vec{\\omega}\\times\\vec{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1163em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使其在垂直方向产生与角速度成正比的微小位移。</p>\n<p>惯性器件最大的工程难题是<strong>零偏漂移</strong>与<strong>温漂</strong>：陀螺零偏随时间积分会让纯惯性导航迅速发散，这正是必须做<a href=\"../systems/sensor-fusion\">传感器融合</a>的根本原因。据 Mordor Intelligence 数据，MEMS 传感器市场预计从 2026 年的约 202 亿美元增长到 2031 年约 291 亿美元，年复合增长约 8%，其中加速度计与速度传感器约占 48% 份额，惯性器件是绝对主力（<a href=\"https://www.mordorintelligence.com/industry-reports/mems-sensor-market\">来源</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"磁场-电流与其它\">磁场、电流与其它</h2><p>磁场传感连接起位置、转速与电流测量。<strong>霍尔传感器</strong> 利用通电半导体在磁场中产生横向电压，可非接触测磁场、转角（配磁铁）与电流（测导线周围磁场）。<strong>磁阻传感器</strong> 家族（AMR/GMR/TMR）电阻随磁场方向变化，灵敏度逐代提高，TMR 已用于高精度编码器与硬盘读头。两者都用于无刷电机的转子位置检测，是<a href=\"../actuators/motors-drives\">电机与驱动</a>闭环控制的眼睛。</p>\n<p>湿度与气体传感则各成一类：电容式湿度传感靠吸湿高分子改变介电常数；气体则有电化学（产生与气体浓度成正比的电流）、金属氧化物半导体（MOX，气体吸附改变电阻）等，普遍存在老化与交叉敏感，常需配合温湿度补偿与算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>物理量传感 = 敏感机理（被测量改变某电参数）+ 读出方式（把电参数变成可放大信号）。</li>\n<li>温度四路线：热电偶（宽量程自源）、RTD（高精度）、NTC（高灵敏低成本）、硅 IC（数字直出）。</li>\n<li>压力靠膜片形变，压阻式走电桥、电容式走低功耗；动态力交给压电（无法测静态）。</li>\n<li>惯性 MEMS 用检测质量块的位移（加速度）与科氏力（角速度），核心痛点是零偏与温漂，故需融合。</li>\n<li>磁场/电流靠霍尔与磁阻，是电机位置闭环的眼睛；这些机理的指标含义统一参见<a href=\"sensor-classification\">传感器分类与特性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"物理量传感","id":"物理量传感"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"温度传感：四条路线的取舍","id":"温度传感-四条路线的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"压力与力：膜片背后的两种物理","id":"压力与力-膜片背后的两种物理"},{"level":2,"text":"惯性传感：MEMS 如何称出加速度与角速度","id":"惯性传感-mems-如何称出加速度与角速度"},{"level":2,"text":"磁场、电流与其它","id":"磁场-电流与其它"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"传感器分类与特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/sensor-classification"},"next":{"title":"光电与成像传感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/photo-imaging-sensing"}}